    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Verschachtelte Bedingungsanweisungen",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne, wie du andere Codeblöcke wie bedingte Anweisungen in Funktionen verschachtelst.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17462,
        "title": "Verschachtelte Bedingungsanweisungen",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Es ist an der Zeit, Funktionen zu erstellen, die Entscheidungen treffen. Als erster Schritt wollen wir sehen, wie man bedingte Anweisungen in Funktionen verschachtelt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, dass Funktionen Codeblöcke sind. Das bedeutet, dass verschachtelte Anweisungen von geschweiften Klammern umgeben sind und zusätzlichen Platz auf der linken Seite haben.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(message);</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können andere Codeblöcke innerhalb einer Funktion hinzufügen. Wenn wir das tun, zeigt uns das zusätzliche Paar geschweifter Klammern, welche Anweisungen wohin gehören.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>}</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Raum links wird <strong>Einrückung</strong> genannt. Wenn wir einen Codeblock in einen anderen einfügen, wird der gesamte Codeblock um einen Abstand eingerückt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"eventName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (eventName === \" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn sound!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound(\" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if (eventName === \"spawn\") {</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(\"Spawn sound!\");</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Einbetten von <code>if</code>-Anweisungen in Funktionen hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden. Jetzt können wir dieselbe <code>if</code>-Anweisung mit einem Funktionsaufruf verwenden.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>canEnterBossRoom</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anweisungen außerhalb von verschachtelten Codeblöcken werden weiterhin ausgeführt, auch wenn der Code innerhalb der Bedingungsanweisung übersprungen wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn wir eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung in eine Funktion einfügen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wir fügen einen Codeblock in einen anderen Codeblock ein</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion wird den <code>if</code>-Block überspringen, wenn sie aufgerufen wird</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wir fügen einen Codeblock in einen anderen Codeblock ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele Anweisungen außerhalb der <code>if</code>-Anweisung hat diese Funktion?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eine Anzeigeanweisung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Keine, alle Anweisungen sind Teil der <code>if</code>-Anweisung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eine Anzeigeanweisung.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennt man den Raum links von einer verschachtelten Anweisung?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Einrückung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Codeblock</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Einrückung aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum ist es nützlich, Bedingungsanweisungen in Funktionen zu verpacken?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es ist nicht so, es ist dasselbe, als ob wir jedes Mal eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung neu schreiben, wenn wir sie brauchen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Anzeigeanweisung wird ausgeführt, wenn <code>checkCollision(false)</code> aufgerufen wird?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkCollision\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"colliding\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collision system running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (colliding === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No collision&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkCollision(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Beide Anzeigeanweisungen werden ausgeführt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur die zweite Display-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Beide Anzeigeanweisungen werden ausgeführt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verschachtle die <code>if</code>-Anweisung innerhalb der Funktion.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"xp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (xp &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>}</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige nur <code>\"Checking XP\"</code> in der Konsole an, indem du es außerhalb der <code>if</code>-Anweisung platzierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isGameOver\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checking health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isGameOver(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Checking health\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Game Over\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige beide Nachrichten in der Konsole an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"alive\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (alive === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is alive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erhöhe <code>health</code> um 50, wenn es weniger als 100 ist. Zeige <code>health</code> am Ende der Funktion an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  health = health + \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>health = health + 50;</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(health);</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Reduziere den <code>score</code> um 500, nur wenn er größer als 2100 ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyPenalty\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  score = score - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = applyPenalty(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}